<title>SWEDEN: Volvo Car '96 invoices by model, market.</title>
<headline>Volvo Car '96 invoices by model, market.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish vehicle maker AB Volvo on Tuesday released the following data about its 1996 car sales and production.</p>
<p> INVOICED CARS BY MODEL    1996     1995     Change in pct</p>
<p> Volvo 960		    34,000   42,100     -19</p>
<p> Volvo 940		    38,600   64,500     -40</p>
<p> Volvo 850		   196,600  186,900	 5.2</p>
<p> Volvo S40/V40		65,300     -	    -</p>
<p> Volvo 400		    33,800   81,100     -58</p>
<p> Total			 368,300  374,600     -1.7</p>
<p>INVOICED CARS BY MARKET</p>
<p> Europe			216,100   219,800    -1.7</p>
<p> North America		93,900    97,700    -3.9</p>
<p> Other markets		58,300    57,100     2.1</p>
<p> Total			 368,300   374,600    -1.7</p>
<p>-- Abigail Schmelz, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1003</p>
</text>
